Description: PHOENIX — AI All-Rounder Assistant for Termux, Linux, macOS & Windows
 PHOENIX is a lightweight AI agent with a web chat interface, ReAct function
 calling, 76 built-in tools, MCP integration, Telegram bot support, and
 always-on voice assistant. Runs on Termux, Linux, macOS, and Windows.
